  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interethnic Memory: Centre of Indigenous Virtual Reference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In partnership with the Public Prossecutor&apos;s Office and the NGO Armaz&#xe9;m Mem&#xf3;ria, the project seeks to enlarge the Virtual Indigenous Centre of Reference with an additional 1.350.000 digitalized pages relevant to the history of indigenous peoples and their lands. Physical arquives to be digitalized are spread out in FUNAI&apos;s main/regional/local offices, in the archives of the Congress (Chamber of Deputies) and civil societu organizations. Training of indigenous researchers in partnership with the Univerity of Brasilia.</narrative>
  </description>
